:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKUSRPRF HELP=HLPWRK KEYL=WRKKEYS TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with User Profiles
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=USERS SCROLL=YES EXTACT=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='CMD ?CRTUSRPRF USRPRF(&WUPNAME.)' HELP='WRKUSRPRF/OPTIONS'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?CHGUSRPRF USRPRF(&WUPNAME.)' HELP='WRKUSRPRF/OPTIONS'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?CRTUSRPRF USRPRF(&WUPNAME.)' HELP='WRKUSRPRF/OPTIONS'.3=Copy
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD DLTUSRPRF USRPRF(&WUPNAME.)' HELP='WRKUSRPRF/OPTIONS'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD DSPUSRPRF USRPRF(&WUPNAME.)' HELP='WRKUSRPRF/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD WRKOBJOWN USRPRF(&WUPNAME.)' HELP='WRKUSRPRF/OPTIONS'.12=Work with objects by owner
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKUSRPRF/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=WUPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES HELP='FLD/WUPNAME'.User Profile
:LISTCOL VAR=WUPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/WUPTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5 or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPDSP.Display User Profile - Help
:P.This display shows a user profile: how its owner signs on, the
password rules that apply to it, its class and special authorities,
its groups and the defaults its jobs start with.
:P.Page down for the rest of the attributes. Press Enter, F3 or F12
to leave. CHGUSRPRF changes them.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPWRK.Work with User Profiles - Help
:P.This display lists the user profiles on the system with their class
and text.
:P.Type an option next to a profile and press Enter: 2 changes it, 4
deletes it, 5 shows it and 12 lists the objects it owns. F6 creates a
new profile.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
