:HELP NAME='FLD/UPCNTRY'.Country or region identifier
:P.The country or region identifier shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/UPCCSID'.Coded character set ID
:P.The coded character set identifier&colon. the code page and character
set the data is in, or is to be converted to.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/UPCHRID'.Character identifier control
:P.How the character identifier of display and printer files is
handled&colon. the device's or the job's CCSID.
:EHELP.
