:P.The user ID number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/UPGID'.Group ID number
:P.The group ID number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/UPHOMDIR'.Home directory
:P.The home directory shown for what the display is about.
